{% comment %}
  Dashed Trustpilot trust strip for the PDP buy box — a short shout line, the
  star tiles (or an uploaded badge in their place) and the Trustpilot wordmark.

  The louder sibling of the Trustpilot rating badge: this one is meant to sit
  tight to the bundle cards or the buy button as an offer reassurance, which is
  why it is dashed and tinted rather than a quiet outlined pill.

  Accepts:
  - block {Object} - the trust_strip block. Reads settings.text and settings.image.

  Usage:
  {% render 'CWC_pdp-trust-strip__block', block: block %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- if block.settings.text != blank or block.settings.image != blank -%}
  <div class="cwc_pdp-product__trustpilot" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
    {%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}
      <span class="cwc_pdp-product__trustpilot-text">{{ block.settings.text }}</span>
    {%- endif -%}

    <span class="cwc_pdp-product__trustpilot-image">
      {%- if block.settings.image != blank -%}
        <img
          src="{{ block.settings.image | image_url: width: 320 }}"
          alt="{{ block.settings.image.alt | default: 'Trustpilot rating' | escape }}"
          loading="lazy"
          width="160"
          height="20"
        >
      {%- else -%}
        {% render 'CWC_trust_stars__block' %}
      {%- endif -%}
    </span>

    <span class="cwc_pdp-product__trustpilot-logo">
      {% render 'CWC_trust_piolet_logo__block' %}
    </span>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
